{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n乃木どこ見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11th singleキャンペーンで\n東京メトロを乃木坂メンバーがジャックしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各駅にメンバー1shotのポスターが貼ってあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n日比谷、二重橋前、桜田門、 有楽町、銀座一丁目\nに貼ってあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23日午前に撤収されちゃうから\n22日までに見に行っておいてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日比谷駅\n日比谷線\n千代田線"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二重橋前駅\n千代田線"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜田門駅\n有楽町線"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有楽町駅\n有楽町線"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"銀座一丁目駅\n有楽町線"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインも書かせてもらったんだけど\n中田はある文字を隠しときました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと遊びました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポスターそれぞれの違う位置に\nその文字が隠されてるから\n探してみてね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n良かったら見に行ってきてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日乗車券を使って\nメンバーコンプもいいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速、今日パパが\n日比谷駅と二重橋前駅に行ったらしいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会社帰りとかで通りかかった人も\n足を止めて見たり\n振り返って見たりしてたらしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい企画。\nありがたや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/16/1655513/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポスターとジャケ写撮影のときの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}